  "title": "The Marvelous Land of Oz - Colophon (Fragment 1)",
  "text": "The Marvelous Land of Oz was published in 1904 by L. Frank Baum.\n\nThis ebook was produced for Standard Ebooks by Maxwell Aires, and is based on a transcription produced in 1993 by Distributed Proofreaders for Project Gutenberg and on digital scans from the HathiTrust Digital Library.\n\nThe cover page is adapted from A Farm in Brittany, a painting completed in 1894 by Paul Gauguin. The cover and title pages feature the League Spartan and Sorts Mill Goudy typefaces created in 2014 and 2009 by The League of Moveable Type.\n\nThis edition was released on August 15, 2026, 5:39 p.m. and is based on revision bb0f8a6. The first edition of this ebook was released on June 23, 2020, 8:25 p.m. You can check for updates to this ebook, view its revision history, or download it for different ereading systems at standardebooks.org/ebooks/l-frank-baum/the-marvelous-land-of-oz.\n\nThe volunteer-driven Standard Ebooks project relies on readers like you to submit typos, corrections, and other improvements. Anyone can contribute at standardebooks.org.",
